from ground_author import *
source('keller-micro','凱勒：微型樁技術','Keller: Micropiles','Keller Group','https://www.keller.com/expertise/techniques/micropiles','公開微型樁、受限空間及基礎托底的用途；不把廠商最大能力當成本課設計值。','Public micropile, restricted-access and underpinning applications; vendor maximum capability is not used as a design value.')
add('b185','既有基礎荷載移交與微型樁複合承載~Existing-foundation load transfer and composite micropile resistance','微型樁托底的關鍵不只是把樁打到深處，而是建立既有柱、承台、連接件與地層之間可驗證的新力流。本課逐步檢查鋼材與黏結承載、預載移交、樁群剛度、無側限段挫屈與低淨高接頭，最後用長期沉陷判讀新舊基礎是否確實共同工作。~Micropile underpinning requires a verified new load path from existing columns through caps and connectors into ground. The course examines steel and bond resistance, preloaded transfer, group stiffness, buckling in unsupported zones and low-headroom joints, then interprets long-term settlement to establish interaction between old and new foundations.',compact(r'''
既有荷載清冊~Existing-load inventory || 托底設計須先辨識目前柱力與未來增載，不能把原設計圖的基礎反力直接當成現況。使用變更、加建及設備集中載重會改變分配，施工期間的臨時支承也需單獨列出，才能決定新樁要接管多少力與何時接管。~Underpinning starts with current column forces and future additions rather than assuming original foundation reactions still apply. Changes of use, extensions and concentrated equipment alter load distribution, and temporary support requires a separate case. These distinctions determine how much load new piles must take and when transfer occurs. || 假設現有柱力800 kN、增建250 kN、設備150 kN，服務荷載合計P=800+250+150=1200 kN~For existing column force 800 kN, extension 250 kN and equipment 150 kN, combined service load P=1200 kN || 核對現況尺寸、使用荷載及裂縫沉陷紀錄，將不同時期荷載分列，與上部結構模型交叉核查。~Check existing dimensions, imposed loads and cracking-settlement records, separating load stages and cross-checking them against the superstructure model. || 漏列新增設備或移除原支承，會使微型樁承擔超出假設的荷載，造成移交後持續沉陷。~Omitted equipment loads or removed original support can impose more load than assumed, causing continued settlement after transfer. || 新樁容量只要大於原設計柱力，就不用查目前用途。~New-pile capacity above the original column force makes current use irrelevant. || 荷載清冊應由上部結構與基礎設計者共同簽認；施工階段和最終使用階段不可混用未標示的力值。~Superstructure and foundation designers jointly sign the load inventory; construction and final-use forces must not be mixed without explicit stage labels. || 直接相加只描述本例同時服務荷載，沒有套用設計分項係數；不同作用組合及既有基礎可分擔比例需另行建立。~Direct addition describes simultaneous service loads in this example only; design factors, combinations and the share retained by existing foundations require separate definition.
鋼材軸應力~Steel axial stress || 微型樁的鋼套管或鋼筋與水泥漿共同傳遞軸力，鋼材分擔比例取決於剛度及接頭連續性。先把全部力分配給鋼材可作特定保守假設，但不代表漿體永遠不參與；腐蝕餘量、套管接頭與局部挫屈也不能靠平均應力取代。~Steel casing or bars share axial force with grout according to stiffness and continuity. Assigning all force to steel may be a specified conservative assumption, but does not imply grout never participates. Corrosion allowance, casing joints and local buckling also require checks beyond an average axial stress. || 假設鋼材獨自承受P=600 kN、有效鋼面積As=0.004 m²，σs=P/As=150 MPa~If steel alone carries P=600 kN over effective area As=0.004 m², σs=P/As=150 MPa || 核對鋼材證書、實際壁厚與接頭型式，將載重試驗應變比較鋼漿共同作用假設。~Verify steel certificates, actual thickness and connection type, comparing load-test strains with the assumed steel-grout composite action. || 把名目壁厚當有效面積可能忽略腐蝕或螺紋減弱，接頭也可能先於完整鋼管失效。~Using nominal thickness can ignore corrosion or thread reductions, and connections may fail before an intact casing section. || 微型樁平均鋼應力不高，就不用檢查接頭與局部挫屈。~Low mean steel stress removes the need for connection and local-buckling checks. || 竣工資料需保留鋼材批號、套管長度及接頭位置；結構設計者確認有效截面後才能接受材料替代。~Retain steel batches, casing lengths and joint positions; the structural designer confirms effective sections before accepting material substitutions. || 這是指定分力下的平均應力，不是微型樁整體承載力；鋼材、漿體、連接及地層黏結需依相容荷載路徑分別檢查。~This is mean stress under an assigned force, not total micropile capacity; steel, grout, connections and ground bond require separate checks on a compatible load path.
地層黏結承載~Ground-bond resistance || 樁端進入良好地層後，軸力沿漿土界面的剪力逐步傳出，荷載傳遞不一定均勻。注漿方式與地層條件影響有效直徑及黏結能力，不能把灌入量直接換成可靠樁徑；承載驗證需要代表性試驗及鑽孔紀錄共同支持。~Axial force transfers progressively through grout-ground shear in the competent stratum and is not necessarily uniform along the bond. Grouting and ground conditions affect effective diameter and bond resistance, but injected volume does not directly establish a reliable diameter. Representative testing and bore records jointly support resistance assessment. || 假設D=0.2 m、黏結長L=8 m、平均可用剪應力τ=150 kPa，R=πDLτ=754 kN~For D=0.2 m, bond length L=8 m and assumed usable mean shear τ=150 kPa, R=πDLτ=754 kN || 將鑽孔地層、注漿回流及試驗曲線按樁號連結，檢查錨固層是否連續並比較不同樁的移動趨勢。~Link bore geology, grout returns and load-test curves by pile identifier, checking continuity of the bond stratum and comparing movement trends between piles. || 黏結段跨入軟弱夾層或漿體不連續會使力集中，可能出現漸進滑移而非鋼材先降伏。~Weak interbeds or discontinuous grout concentrate transfer and can produce progressive slip before steel yielding. || 注漿量很多就必然得到較大且完整的黏結直徑。~High grout volume necessarily creates a larger continuous bond diameter. || 黏結參數及驗證樁位置需由地工設計者核准；任何異常回流或地層變更都要保留追查紀錄。~The geotechnical designer approves bond parameters and verification-pile locations; abnormal returns or changed strata retain traceable investigation records. || 本式假設均勻平均剪力且有效直徑可信，未含群體作用與長期效應；試驗允收還需同時檢查位移和潛變。~The expression assumes uniform mean shear and credible diameter, excluding group and long-term effects; test acceptance must also address displacement and creep.
承台連接~Cap connection || 新微型樁必須透過承台、剪力環或其他核定連接把力接入舊基礎，單樁有容量不等於既有柱力已找到新路徑。舊混凝土品質、邊距及鋼筋位置會控制局部承壓與劈裂，施工擾動也可能削弱原有基礎的剩餘能力。~New micropiles need a cap, shear rings or another approved connector to receive load from the old foundation. Pile capacity alone does not establish a new path for column force. Existing concrete quality, edge distance and reinforcement govern local bearing and splitting, while construction disturbance may reduce residual foundation capacity. || 假設連接傳力P=400 kN、有效承壓面A=0.08 m²，p=P/A=5 MPa~For transferred connection force P=400 kN and effective bearing area A=0.08 m², p=P/A=5 MPa || 以探測及局部取樣確認舊基礎，核對連接面與鋼筋淨距，將實際傳力方向放入節點模型。~Investigate the existing foundation with scanning and justified sampling, verify connection faces and reinforcement clearance, and model the actual force direction. || 舊混凝土劈裂或接面滑移會使新樁未能接管，即使單樁載重試驗合格，柱仍持續下沉。~Splitting of old concrete or interface slip can prevent takeover despite a successful pile load test, leaving the column settling. || 微型樁試驗合格就代表與舊基礎的連接也合格。~A successful micropile load test proves the old-foundation connection is adequate. || 連接細部應在現況調查後核定；舊構件切削與新增孔洞由既有結構設計者確認剩餘力流再施工。~Finalize connections after existing-condition investigation; the existing-structure designer confirms remaining load paths before cutting or drilling new openings. || 平均承壓不包含局部劈裂、沖切及錨定需求，舊材料強度亦可能不均；完整節點驗算不能由此單式取代。~Mean bearing excludes splitting, punching and anchorage, and existing strength may vary; this single equation cannot replace complete node analysis.
預載荷載移交~Preloaded transfer || 新樁若沒有預先接觸或預載，往往要等舊基礎再沉陷才逐步動員，不能假設施工完成即分擔設計荷載。預載的目的在控制接管路徑及位移，但過大推力也可能抬升上部結構；須同時監測力與柱、承台的相對移動。~Without established contact or preload, a new pile may need further old-foundation settlement before it mobilizes. Completion alone does not mean it carries the intended share. Preload controls transfer and movement, but excessive force can lift the structure, requiring simultaneous force and relative column-cap displacement monitoring. || 假設需移交ΔP=300 kN、等效剛度k=100 kN/mm，彈性位移δ=ΔP/k=3 mm~For transfer increment ΔP=300 kN and equivalent stiffness k=100 kN/mm, elastic movement δ=ΔP/k=3 mm || 比對新樁力、舊基礎沉陷與連接間隙，確認接管過程沒有造成局部抬升或未知支承卸載。~Compare new-pile force, old-foundation settlement and connection gaps to confirm that transfer causes neither local uplift nor unintended unloading elsewhere. || 只看施加荷重而不看位移，可能在接管前先抬升樓板，損傷既有脆性接縫。~Monitoring applied force without movement can lift slabs before intended transfer and damage existing brittle joints. || 新樁完工後會立刻自然承擔所有設計荷載比例。~Completed new piles immediately carry every intended design load share naturally. || 荷載移交須設結構及地工共同停留點；核定力位移範圍後，才可解除原有臨時支承。~Load transfer requires a joint structural-geotechnical hold point; original temporary support is released only after approved force-displacement conditions are demonstrated. || 剛度位移式假設接觸已建立且線性，未含原始間隙與舊基礎塑性；本例不提供現場頂升程序或施力目標。~The stiffness relation assumes established linear contact and excludes initial gaps and old-foundation plasticity; it does not prescribe jacking procedures or field force targets.
新舊樁群分力~Pile-group load sharing || 共用承台下不同樁的剛度與初始接觸決定荷載分配，並非單純按樁數平均。新樁與舊基礎可能有不同沉陷歷史與端承條件；等位移模型有助說明剛度比例，但需要承台近似剛性且沒有額外轉動才成立。~Relative stiffness and initial contact govern load sharing beneath a common cap rather than pile count alone. New piles and old foundations have different settlement histories and toe conditions. An equal-displacement model illustrates stiffness sharing only when the cap is sufficiently rigid and additional rotation is absent. || 假設兩組剛度k₁=200、k₂=100 MN/m，共承P=1200 kN且等位移，P₁=Pk₁/(k₁+k₂)=800 kN~For groups k₁=200 and k₂=100 MN/m sharing P=1200 kN at equal displacement, P₁=Pk₁/(k₁+k₂)=800 kN || 量測承台轉角與代表樁軸力，核對是否等位移，將不同樁的載重試驗剛度用於比較。~Measure cap rotation and representative pile forces to test equal displacement, using individual load-test stiffnesses for comparison. || 把剛度不同的樁平均分力，可能讓較硬新樁提前超載，較軟支承卻尚未有效參與。~Equal-force allocation between unequal stiffnesses can overload the stiff new group before softer supports contribute effectively. || 同一承台下所有微型樁一定平均分擔柱力。~Every micropile under one cap necessarily shares column load equally. || 分力模型應納入承台轉動與初始荷載；基礎設計者用試驗及監測修正後，再核定最終移交狀態。~Include cap rotation and initial loading in sharing models; the foundation designer updates them with tests and monitoring before approving final transfer. || 並聯彈簧模型未含土體群效與非線性，單組剛度應對應相同荷載區間；舊樁歷史力不能直接重新平均。~Parallel springs exclude group-soil interaction and nonlinearity; stiffnesses must correspond to the same load range, and historical force in old piles cannot simply be redistributed by averaging.
無側限段挫屈~Unsupported-length buckling || 微型樁通常受到周圍地層側向約束，但穿越空洞、極軟層或施工開挖區時可能形成無側限長度。鋼套管的挫屈能力便成為重要限制，不能因樁很深就假設全長都有連續支承；接頭偏心與腐蝕也會放大不利影響。~Ground normally restrains micropiles laterally, but voids, very soft layers or excavation can create unsupported lengths. Casing buckling then becomes critical; depth does not guarantee continuous support. Joint eccentricity and corrosion amplify the vulnerability and require checking the actual restrained length rather than assuming full confinement. || 理想鉸接段L=4 m、E=200 GPa、I=1×10⁻⁵ m⁴，Pcr=π²EI/L²=1.23 MN~For an ideal pinned unsupported segment L=4 m, E=200 GPa and I=1×10⁻⁵ m⁴, Pcr=π²EI/L²=1.23 MN || 依鑽孔與開挖紀錄界定無側限區，核對套管接頭位置與直線度，檢查橫向地層彈簧可信度。~Define unsupported zones from drilling and excavation records, check casing-joint locations and straightness, and assess credibility of lateral ground springs. || 隱藏空洞使有效長度增加，可能在軸應力仍低時發生挫屈，造成托底支承突然失效。~A hidden void increases effective length and may trigger buckling at low axial stress, abruptly compromising underpinning support. || 微型樁埋在地下，所以任何位置都不需要挫屈檢查。~A buried micropile never requires buckling checks anywhere along its length. || 無側限區與套管需求應明列於施工圖；地層流失或新增開挖發現後，設計者須重新核對穩定。~Show unsupported zones and casing requirements on drawings; the designer reassesses stability when ground loss or additional excavation occurs. || 歐拉荷重是理想彈性上限，不是允許工作荷載；實際承載需考慮初彎、接頭、塑性與有效端部拘束。~Euler load is an ideal elastic limit, not working-load permission; actual resistance includes bow, joints, plasticity and effective end restraint.
偏心樁群反力~Eccentric group reactions || 柱中心與新樁群中心不一致時，除了總軸力還會產生力矩，承台需透過不同樁反力或拉壓偶抵抗。若只把總力平均分到樁上，邊樁需求會被低估；既有基礎是否仍接觸也會改變可用的反力分布。~An offset between column and new pile-group centres creates moment in addition to total axial load. The cap resists it through unequal reactions or a tension-compression couple. Averaging total force underestimates edge-pile demand, while continued contact with the original foundation changes the available reaction distribution. || 假設需抵抗力矩M=300 kN·m、兩反力線距s=2 m，力偶增量ΔP=M/s=150 kN~For moment M=300 kN·m and reaction-line spacing s=2 m, couple-force increment ΔP=M/s=150 kN || 核對柱樁中心與實際樁位，量測承台轉角及邊樁力，將接觸或離縫狀態納入模型。~Check actual column and pile centres, measure cap rotation and edge forces, and include contact or separation in the model. || 邊樁可能受拉而原設計只查受壓，接頭與舊承台因此可能先裂開，形成非預期荷載重分配。~An edge pile may enter tension although only compression was checked, cracking connections or the old cap and redistributing load unexpectedly. || 柱力是向下的，就不可能讓任何托底樁受到拉力。~A downward column load can never put an underpinning pile in tension. || 群樁設計應列垂直力及雙向彎矩組合；樁位超差須由基礎設計者核准重新分力後才驗收。~Group design includes vertical force and biaxial moment combinations; the foundation designer redistributes forces and approves out-of-position piles before acceptance. || 力偶式只給兩反力線的增量，不是每樁總力；須加上平均軸力並檢查承台剛度及拉力傳遞是否成立。~The couple equation gives the increment on two reaction lines, not total force per pile; add mean axial load and verify cap stiffness and tensile transfer.
低淨高接頭~Low-headroom splices || 受限空間的微型樁需以短節鋼材連接，接頭數增加就增加製造、安裝與檢查界面。每個接頭必須傳遞設計軸力及可能的彎曲，螺紋有效截面與套管同軸度也影響承載；施工方便不能取代接合性能證明。~Restricted headroom requires short steel sections, increasing fabrication, installation and inspection interfaces. Every splice must transfer design axial force and possible bending, while thread-root area and casing alignment affect resistance. Ease of installation cannot substitute for evidence that the connection performs under the required force combinations. || 假設總長L=18 m、每節有效長l=1.5 m，需n=ceil(L/l)=12節，通常有11個節間接頭~For total length L=18 m and effective section length l=1.5 m, n=ceil(L/l)=12 sections, normally with eleven inter-section joints || 核對每節長度、接頭序號與安裝證據，對照實際接頭深度及高彎曲或腐蝕區，查漏裝與錯件。~Verify section lengths, splice identifiers and installation evidence against actual depths and high-bending or corrosion zones, checking missing or mismatched parts. || 接頭未完全接合或軸線偏移會降低有效容量，深埋後難以直接檢查，可能成為長期薄弱點。~Incomplete engagement or misalignment reduces effective resistance and can become a long-term weak point that is difficult to inspect after burial. || 接頭越多只會影響速度，不會影響樁的受力品質。~More splices affect speed only and never structural quality. || 接頭型式、檢驗方法及追溯編碼須由結構設計者核准；未完成接合檢查的鋼節不得以後續注漿取代驗證。~The structural designer approves splice type, inspection and traceability; later grouting cannot replace verification of an unaccepted steel connection. || 節數計算假設有效長度已扣除接合損失，並非加工切割清單；實際端部、接頭搭接與設備淨高需另外協調。~The section count assumes effective lengths already exclude connection loss and is not a fabrication cut list; ends, overlap and equipment headroom require separate coordination.
移交後沉陷~Post-transfer settlement || 托底後的沉陷可能來自新樁動員、舊土層壓密或連接變形，不應只以短期試驗合格結束觀察。長期趨勢需與荷載使用、地下水及季節變化一起判讀，固定基準與測點位置則是區分真變形與量測漂移的前提。~Post-underpinning settlement may reflect new-pile mobilization, consolidation of old soils or connection movement, so short-term test acceptance should not end observation. Long-term trends require load-use, groundwater and seasonal context, with stable references and fixed measurement locations to distinguish actual deformation from instrumental drift. || 假設沉陷由3 mm增至4 mm、間隔6 month，平均速率v=(4−3)/6=0.167 mm/month~For settlement increasing from 3 mm to 4 mm over six months, mean rate v=(4−3)/6=0.167 mm/month || 將柱、承台及相鄰未托底基礎同步水準測量，對照使用荷載及水位，檢查差異而非只看單點。~Level columns, caps and adjacent untreated foundations together, comparing loads and groundwater and examining differences rather than one isolated point. || 停止追蹤可能漏掉連接逐步滑移，直到門窗卡住或新裂縫出現才發現托底尚未穩定。~Stopping observations can miss progressive connection slip until doors bind or new cracks reveal that underpinning performance has not stabilized. || 載重試驗通過後，既有建物不需要再做沉陷監測。~Passing a load test removes the need for further building-settlement monitoring. || 交接列出監測期限、終止條件及使用變更通報；異常速率由地工與既有結構設計者共同判讀。~Handover defines monitoring duration, closure criteria and change-of-use reporting; geotechnical and existing-structure designers jointly interpret abnormal movement rates. || 平均速率可能掩蓋階段性加速，且本數值不是通用合格值；應以資產容許差異變形及量測解析度制定判據。~The mean rate can conceal episodic acceleration and is not a universal acceptance value; criteria depend on tolerable differential movement and measurement resolution.
'''),'原創教學例：現有柱力800 kN、增建250 kN、設備150 kN，在本例同時使用情境下合計1200 kN。若只增加現有柱力10%至880 kN，其他兩項維持不變，合計變成1280 kN，總需求增加80 kN或6.67%，而不是10%。還須按上部結構規範建立荷載組合，並確定新舊基礎如何分力。此加總不代表每根新樁平均分擔，也不證明承台連接或荷載移交完成；應以樁力、承台位移及現況調查共同驗證。~Original teaching example: an existing column carries 800 kN, an extension adds 250 kN and equipment adds 150 kN, giving 1200 kN in this simultaneous-use scenario. Increase only the existing-column component by 10% to 880 kN while holding the others fixed: total demand becomes 1280 kN, up 80 kN or 6.67%, not 10%. Appropriate structural load combinations and new-old foundation sharing remain necessary. This sum implies neither equal sharing by new piles nor completed cap connection and load transfer. Verify those using pile forces, cap movement and existing-condition investigation.',['fhwa-micro','keller-micro','geo-site'],['倫敦哈利街一四一號：低淨高樁施工比較~141 Harley Street: low-headroom piling comparison','倫敦國家美術館：受限空間樁施工比較~National Gallery, London: restricted-access piling comparison'])

add('b186','噴射侵蝕、改良體連續性與水力驗證~Jet erosion, treated-ground continuity and hydraulic verification','噴射灌漿以高能流體侵蝕並混合原土，形成幾何與材料性質受地層控制的改良體。本課區分止水與承載需求，從滲流、咬合、材料留存及返漿量平衡出發，逐步檢查強度發展、複合地盤分力、鑽孔偏斜和統計變異，最後以水力試驗驗證整體功能。~Jet grouting erodes and mixes soil to form treated bodies whose geometry and properties depend on ground conditions. The course separates cutoff and bearing functions, linking seepage, overlap, binder retention and return balance to strength, composite-ground sharing, bore deviation and variability, then verifies overall performance hydraulically.',compact(r'''
改良體滲流~Treated-ground seepage || 改良體用於止水時，連續性與最弱路徑可能比試體抗壓強度更重要。均質達西模型可估平均流量，但施工接面、未改良夾層或縮頸會提供短路徑，平均滲透係數低並不能保證整個帷幕水密；驗收須同時涵蓋材料與幾何。~For a cutoff, continuity and the weakest path may matter more than specimen compressive strength. A homogeneous Darcy model estimates mean flow, but interfaces, untreated seams and necking create bypasses. Low average permeability therefore does not prove a sealed curtain; acceptance must address both material properties and geometry. || 假設k=1×10⁻⁸ m/s、面積A=100 m²、坡降i=2，Q=kAi=2×10⁻⁶ m³/s~For k=1×10⁻⁸ m/s, area A=100 m² and gradient i=2, Q=kAi=2×10⁻⁶ m³/s || 對照跨帷幕水頭與分區水量，配合取芯及施工位置圖，區分均質滲透和局部短路。~Compare heads across the curtain and zoned flows with cores and installation positions, distinguishing distributed permeability from local bypass paths. || 高強度試體可能來自完整區，而未取到的縮頸仍會漏水帶砂，使整體止水失效。~Strong specimens may come from intact zones while unsampled necks still leak and transport soil, defeating the overall cutoff. || 噴射改良體抗壓強度高就一定具有足夠止水能力。~High jet-grouted compressive strength guarantees adequate cutoff performance. || 設計應分列強度、滲透及連續性要求；地工設計者確認各項證據，不以單一試體結果替代整體驗證。~Specify strength, permeability and continuity separately; the geotechnical designer reviews each evidence stream rather than replacing system verification with one specimen result. || 達西式假設代表性均質與層流，不能描述開放缺口；流量低亦可能由水頭不足造成，試驗邊界必須記錄。~Darcy flow assumes representative homogeneous laminar behaviour and does not describe open gaps; low discharge can also result from insufficient test head, which must be recorded.
柱體交疊~Column overlap || 噴射柱的直徑隨土種、設備反應與施工條件改變，設計中心距必須給直徑變異留出餘裕。相鄰柱在某個深度相交，不代表全深都連續；黏土團塊、礫石或夾層可能讓截面不圓，應以試驗柱與全深證據建立保守幾何。~Jet-column diameter changes with soil, equipment response and execution conditions, so spacing must accommodate variability. Intersection at one depth does not establish full-depth continuity. Clay lumps, gravel and layering can create noncircular sections, requiring trial columns and full-depth evidence to define conservative geometry. || 假設有效直徑D=1.5 m、中心距s=1.2 m，名目咬合o=D−s=0.3 m~For effective diameter D=1.5 m and centre spacing s=1.2 m, nominal overlap o=D−s=0.3 m || 以試驗柱揭露或核定探測取得分層直徑，結合孔斜重建最小交疊，不只查柱頂。~Obtain layered diameters from exposed trial columns or approved investigation, combining them with bore deviation to reconstruct minimum overlap beyond the column head. || 局部縮頸可能留下貫通水路，即使柱頂直徑達標也無法彌補深部未交疊。~Local necking can leave a connected water path that adequate head diameter cannot compensate for. || 每支柱頂直徑達標就能保證整個改良區無缺口。~Compliant diameter at every column head guarantees a gap-free treatment zone. || 柱距及補柱決策須依最不利地層試驗；地工設計者核定幾何不確定度與驗證位置後才施工。~Spacing and supplementary columns follow trials in adverse strata; the geotechnical designer approves geometric uncertainty and verification locations before execution. || 等直徑咬合式只描述理想平行圓柱，真實不規則截面需用最小有效尺寸；重疊也不自動證明接面黏結。~Equal-diameter overlap describes ideal parallel cylinders only; irregular sections require minimum effective dimensions, and intersection does not automatically demonstrate interface bond.
膠結材料留存~Binder retention || 注入膠結材料有一部分隨返漿排出，另一部分留在地盤中參與固化，所以投入量不能直接當改良體配比。原土含水及返漿固體濃度會影響質量平衡，若只量體積而不量密度與成分，便無法合理判定實際留存量。~Some injected binder leaves with returns while the remainder participates in ground solidification, so input quantity is not the treated-body mix ratio. Soil water and return solids affect the mass balance. Volume alone, without density and composition, cannot reliably establish how much binder remains in the ground. || 假設注入乾膠結材Min=1000 kg、返漿帶出同材Mout=250 kg，留存Mret=Min−Mout=750 kg~For injected dry binder Min=1000 kg and the same binder recovered in returns Mout=250 kg, retained Mret=750 kg || 同步量注入與返漿體積、密度及代表性固體成分，明確區分原土固體與膠結材。~Measure input and return volumes, densities and representative solids together, explicitly distinguishing native-soil solids from binder. || 將返漿全部固體當水泥或忽略返出損失，會錯估留存配比，造成強度預測與實測不符。~Treating all return solids as cement or ignoring binder loss misstates retained mix and causes strength predictions to diverge from tests. || 注入多少水泥就有多少水泥留在設計改良柱內。~All injected cement remains inside the intended treated column. || 質量表需註明取樣方法與成分不確定度；材料負責人及地工設計者共同解釋異常留存率後才調整方案。~The balance identifies sampling and composition uncertainty; materials and geotechnical leads interpret anomalous retention together before modifying the scheme. || 此式假設能識別返出的同一膠結材料，未計側向漏失與未採樣流路；留存質量也不等於均勻混合程度。~The expression assumes recovered binder can be identified and excludes lateral loss and unsampled paths; retained mass does not establish uniform mixing.
直徑面積效應~Diameter-area effect || 改良柱直徑影響承載面積與交疊，但增大幾何尺寸不一定同比增加均勻強度區。噴射侵蝕受地層可侵蝕性控制，粗粒或高塑性夾層可讓外形及品質不同；方案比較應把幾何面積、材料性能與有效受力區分開列示。~Column diameter affects bearing area and overlap, but larger geometry does not necessarily enlarge the uniformly strong zone proportionally. Erodibility controls jet response, and coarse or highly plastic layers change shape and quality. Compare geometric area, material performance and effective loaded area separately in option studies. || 假設圓截面直徑由D₁=1.0 m增至D₂=1.4 m，面積比A₂/A₁=(D₂/D₁)²=1.96~For circular diameters D₁=1.0 m and D₂=1.4 m, area ratio A₂/A₁=(D₂/D₁)²=1.96 || 以分層試驗柱尺寸與取芯均勻度比較不同方案，檢查增加面積是否位於實際受力或止水區。~Compare layered trial-column dimensions and core uniformity, checking whether additional area lies within the actual bearing or cutoff zone. || 用理想直徑放大容量可能忽略邊緣低強度區，造成受力集中與不均勻壓縮。~Scaling resistance by ideal diameter can overlook weak margins, concentrating load and producing differential compression. || 直徑增加百分之四十，容量就必定增加百分之九十六。~A forty-percent diameter increase necessarily raises capacity by ninety-six percent. || 設計圖須區分名目直徑與有效改良直徑；地工設計者依試驗結果核定用於承載的範圍。~Distinguish nominal and effective treated diameters on drawings; the geotechnical designer approves the area credited for resistance from trial evidence. || 面積比只是幾何結果，沒有包含強度、端承、黏結或群效；有效容量仍需按實際失效模式與品質變異檢核。~The ratio is geometric only and excludes strength, toe resistance, bond and group effects; usable capacity follows actual failure mechanisms and quality variability.
返漿體積平衡~Return-volume balance || 返漿提供注入流體及被侵蝕土粒離開地盤的路徑，返漿不足可能是滯留、堵塞或側向漏失，不能直接解釋為改良效率提高。體積差需連同密度、地表隆起及孔隙水壓判讀，才能分辨材料留存與不希望的地層位移。~Returns provide an exit for injected fluid and eroded soil. Reduced returns may indicate retention, blockage or lateral loss rather than improved treatment efficiency. Interpret volume differences with density, surface heave and pore pressure to distinguish useful material retention from undesirable displacement of the surrounding ground. || 假設注入Vin=4 m³、量得返出Vout=3.2 m³，未平衡體積ΔV=0.8 m³~For input Vin=4 m³ and measured returns Vout=3.2 m³, unbalanced volume ΔV=0.8 m³ || 同步記錄返漿量、孔壓與地表位移，追查取樣及儲槽延遲，避免把暫時管內容積當地下留存。~Synchronize returns, pore pressure and surface movement, checking sampling and tank delays so that temporary pipe storage is not counted as subsurface retention. || 返漿通道阻塞可使地層隆起或漿液沿弱面外逸，鄰近管線可能在柱體強度形成前就受損。~Blocked returns can heave ground or force grout along weak planes, damaging nearby utilities before column strength develops. || 返漿越少代表水泥留得越多，所以一定更好。~Less return means more retained cement and is therefore always better. || 返漿異常與隆起應有共同停留點；地工及施工負責人查明去向後，才核定後續施工條件。~Provide a joint hold point for abnormal returns and heave; geotechnical and construction leads determine material destination before approving further work. || 體積差不是純土體壓縮量，也不是乾膠結材質量；含水、氣泡、原土排出及量測延遲都可能影響此平衡。~Volume difference is neither pure soil compression nor dry binder mass; water, air, removed native soil and measurement delay all affect the balance.
強度齡期發展~Strength development || 水泥土強度隨齡期及養護條件增加，但土體有機物、含水量與混合均勻度可能限制反應。早期強度與後期強度比例可比較材料發展，卻不能把單一比值套到所有土層；現場芯樣的擾動與尺寸也需和室內試體區分。~Soil-cement strength develops with age and curing, but organic content, water and mixing uniformity can limit reactions. An early-to-late strength ratio compares development but is not universal across strata. Disturbance and dimensions of field cores must also be distinguished from laboratory specimens when interpreting the apparent gain. || 假設同類試體早期qu₁=1.2 MPa、後期qu₂=2.4 MPa，強度比qu₂/qu₁=2.0~For comparable specimens with early qu₁=1.2 MPa and later qu₂=2.4 MPa, strength ratio qu₂/qu₁=2.0 || 依地層與齡期分組試驗，保留養護溫度、尺寸與破壞型態，檢查現場取芯是否代表弱區。~Group tests by stratum and age, retaining curing temperature, specimen dimensions and failure mode, and check whether field cores represent weak zones. || 只挑完整芯樣會高估強度，未成芯區若被排除，最薄弱的改良體可能完全沒有進入統計。~Selecting only intact cores inflates strength; excluding uncoreable intervals can remove the weakest treated ground from the statistics entirely. || 後期平均強度加倍，就代表所有位置都同樣加倍。~A doubled later mean strength means every location doubled equally. || 試驗計畫應預先處理取芯失敗與異常低值；材料及地工設計者共同判讀，不能任意刪除不利資料。~The testing plan defines treatment of core loss and low results in advance; materials and geotechnical designers interpret them without arbitrary removal of adverse data. || 強度比不是長期耐久或水密證明，且必須使用可比較的試體與試驗方法；不同養護條件不得直接合併。~The ratio proves neither durability nor sealing and requires comparable specimens and methods; incompatible curing conditions must not be pooled directly.
複合地盤分力~Composite-ground sharing || 改良柱與周圍原土共同承受上部荷載，剛度較高的柱往往承擔較高應力。等應變模型可推導柱土應力比，但需有足夠剛性上部荷載分配層；柔性載重、局部沉陷與柱端條件會使真實分力偏離簡化模型。~Treated columns and native soil share load, with stiffer columns generally carrying greater stress. Equal-strain analysis derives a column-soil stress ratio but requires sufficiently rigid load distribution. Flexible loading, local settlement and toe conditions can produce sharing that differs substantially from the simplified relation. || 假設平均q=100 kPa、面積比a=0.3、柱土剛度比n=5且等應變，σc=q/[a+(1−a)/n]=227 kPa~For mean q=100 kPa, area ratio a=0.3 and stiffness ratio n=5 under equal strain, σc=q/[a+(1−a)/n]=227 kPa || 量測柱頂及土間壓力與沉陷，核對荷載分配層剛度，使用相同荷載範圍的柱土模數。~Measure column-head and intervening-soil pressures with settlement, check load-transfer-layer stiffness, and use moduli from matching load ranges. || 只把平均載重當柱應力會低估柱體需求，局部破壞後荷載又轉到鄰柱並擴大差異沉陷。~Using average load as column stress understates demand; local column failure transfers force to neighbours and enlarges differential settlement. || 改良區平均壓力就是每根改良柱承受的壓力。~Mean pressure over the treated area equals pressure in every column. || 設計者應明確標示等應變假設與負載轉移層；試驗不支持此假設時，需改用符合實際邊界的互制分析。~The designer states equal-strain and load-transfer-layer assumptions; if measurements do not support them, use an interaction model consistent with actual boundaries. || 式中n是相應應變下的剛度比，不是抗壓強度比；柱體承載、原土剪力與整體沉陷仍須分別檢查。~Here n is a stiffness ratio at corresponding strain, not a strength ratio; column resistance, native-soil shear and overall settlement still require separate checks.
鑽孔偏斜~Bore deviation || 噴射柱的軸線取決於鑽孔軌跡，深部小偏斜會減少相鄰柱交疊或接近地下資產。名目柱徑不能自動吸收所有偏差，尤其在需閉合止水的底部或轉角；幾何驗證應採實際軌跡而不是只有地面放樣位置。~The bore trajectory defines the column axis, and small deep deviations can reduce overlap or approach buried assets. Nominal diameter cannot absorb every error, especially near cutoff toes and corners. Geometric verification must therefore use actual trajectories rather than ground-level setting-out positions alone. || 假設深度H=20 m、恆定偏斜比i=0.01，底部偏移δ=Hi=0.20 m~For depth H=20 m and constant inclination ratio i=0.01, toe offset δ=Hi=0.20 m || 使用核定孔斜方法記錄全深軌跡，將其與管線調查及相鄰柱最小直徑重疊分析。~Record full-depth trajectory with an approved deviation method and combine it with utility investigation and minimum adjacent-column diameter. || 柱軸朝外偏移會留下改良缺口，朝資產偏移則可能改變周邊土體與既有結構接觸。~Outward deviation leaves treatment gaps, while deviation toward an asset can alter surrounding ground and its contact with the existing structure. || 地面樁位符合容差，就無需再查深部軸線。~Compliant surface position removes the need to check the deep column axis. || 高風險界面需設孔斜查核停留點；地工設計者與資產管理者共同確認所需幾何餘量。~High-risk interfaces require a bore-deviation hold point; the geotechnical designer and asset owner jointly confirm the required geometric reserve. || 固定偏斜式是線性估算，真實曲線軌跡要逐段積分；偏移方向與相鄰柱相關性比單一絕對值更重要。~The constant-inclination formula is linear; curved trajectories require integration, and deviation direction and correlation between adjacent columns matter more than one absolute value.
強度變異係數~Strength variability || 水泥土品質具有空間變異，平均值相同的兩個改良區可能有很不同的低強度尾端。變異係數把標準差相對平均值表達，適合初步比較均勻度，但不能指出缺陷在哪裡；取樣位置及未成芯區會強烈影響統計代表性。~Soil-cement quality varies spatially, so areas with the same mean can have different weak tails. Coefficient of variation expresses standard deviation relative to mean and helps compare uniformity, but does not locate defects. Sampling positions and uncoreable intervals strongly affect whether the statistics represent the treated ground. || 假設強度平均μ=2.0 MPa、標準差s=0.6 MPa，CV=s/μ=0.30~For strength mean μ=2.0 MPa and standard deviation s=0.6 MPa, CV=s/μ=0.30 || 依柱號、深度與地層繪製強度分布，同時列樣本數及取芯失敗，不只提供一個平均值。~Map strength by column, depth and stratum, reporting sample count and core loss together rather than only a mean. || 少量高值可能把平均拉高，掩蓋連續低強度帶；刪除取芯失敗會讓變異看似過小。~A few high values can raise the mean and hide a continuous weak band; excluding core loss makes variability appear artificially small. || 平均強度達標就不必理會分布尾端與取樣位置。~Meeting mean strength makes the lower tail and sampling positions irrelevant. || 統計判據與弱區補證方法應在取樣前核定；地工設計者依空間模式決定補強，不能只改報表平均值。~Approve statistical criteria and weak-zone verification before sampling; the geotechnical designer selects remedies from spatial patterns rather than adjusting reported averages. || 變異係數是描述統計，沒有通用合格上限；分層材料或混合族群應分組，不能假設所有試體屬同一常態分布。~CV is descriptive, without a universal pass threshold; layered or mixed populations require grouping rather than assuming all specimens follow one normal distribution.
水力坡降反算~Back-calculated gradient || 完工水力試驗需把流量與水頭及幾何一起解讀，否則低出水可能只因施加水頭小。若已知代表性滲透係數及面積，可由達西式反算坡降，但這是無因次量，不是水頭差；要得到水頭差仍需有效流路長度。~Completion hydraulic tests require flow, head and geometry together, because low discharge may only reflect a low applied head. With representative permeability and area, Darcy flow can infer a dimensionless gradient, not a head difference. An effective flow-path length is still needed to convert that gradient into hydraulic head. || 假設Q=1×10⁻⁵ m³/s、k=1×10⁻⁷ m/s、A=100 m²，i=Q/(kA)=1；若另假設L=1 m才有Δh=iL=1 m~For Q=1×10⁻⁵ m³/s, k=1×10⁻⁷ m/s and A=100 m², i=Q/(kA)=1; only with additional L=1 m does Δh=iL=1 m || 同時記錄試驗流量、上下游水頭及濾管位置，以不同水頭檢查線性，追查短路或邊界漏失。~Record flow, upstream-downstream heads and screen positions together, checking linearity at different heads and investigating bypasses or boundary losses. || 將坡降誤寫成水頭差會漏掉流路長度，錯估止水需求；試驗邊界漏水也可能被誤判為改良體滲透。~Mislabeling gradient as head omits path length and distorts cutoff demand; test-boundary leakage can also be mistaken for treated-ground permeability. || 流量除以滲透係數與面積，得到的單位就是公尺。~Flow divided by permeability and area has units of metres. || 交接水力報告須列公式單位、有效面積及流路假設；地工設計者確認邊界可識別後才接受反算結果。~Handover hydraulic reports state units, effective area and path assumptions; the geotechnical designer accepts inferred properties only after test boundaries are identifiable. || 反算若同時未知k、面積與流長便不唯一，不能用單一流量解出所有參數；局部缺口需另外檢測定位。~Inversion is nonunique when permeability, area and path length are all unknown; one flow cannot determine them all, and local defects require separate location methods.
'''),'原創教學例：假設均質改良體滲透係數k=1×10⁻⁸ m/s、面積A=100 m²、水力坡降i=2，流量Q=kAi=2×10⁻⁶ m³/s。只把k增加10%至1.1×10⁻⁸ m/s，其他量不變，Q=2.2×10⁻⁶ m³/s，也增加10%。此線性敏感度只對固定幾何與達西流成立；若有貫通缺口，總流量可能由另一機制控制。驗證時要記錄上下游水頭、面積與有效流路，並結合取芯及全深幾何，不能用低流量或高強度單獨宣稱整體止水合格。~Original teaching example: assume homogeneous permeability k=1×10⁻⁸ m/s, area A=100 m² and hydraulic gradient i=2. Darcy discharge is Q=kAi=2×10⁻⁶ m³/s. Increase only k by 10% to 1.1×10⁻⁸ m/s while holding other inputs fixed: Q becomes 2.2×10⁻⁶ m³/s, also up 10%. This linear sensitivity requires fixed geometry and Darcy flow; a connected defect may instead control total discharge through another mechanism. Verification records upstream and downstream heads, area and effective paths, combining cores and full-depth geometry rather than inferring system sealing from low flow or high strength alone. The designer must verify that the test boundaries represent the intended permanent hydraulic condition.',['keller-jet','fhwa-ground','geo-site'],['Crossrail聯絡通道：地盤處理方案比較~Crossrail cross passages: ground-treatment comparison','倫敦哈利街地下室：改良與樁牆界面比較~Harley Street basement: treatment and pile-wall interface comparison'])
if __name__=='__main__': write()
